        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Faraday, Robert Bunsen\n- Products: laboratory burner, Bunsen burner, Teclu burner\n- Roles: laboratory assistant, English scientist\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Faraday was born on Saturday 22 September 1791.\n- Michael Faraday was an English scientist.\n- Michael Faraday designed a laboratory burner.\n- Robert Bunsen’s laboratory assistant later perfected Michael Faraday’s laboratory burner design.\n- The perfected device was the Bunsen burner.\n- The Teclu burner is a hotter-flamed variant of the Bunsen burner.",
